      "slideImagePath" : "\/Volumes\/ZSSD\/GitHub\/repository\/TohoStudio\/.cache\/keynote_slides\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa\/元女子校の日常　第16話_791a4f77fa.047.jpeg",
